WEBVTT

00:00:03.186 --> 00:00:08.210
When a call does not reach the agent you expect, open Reports, Queue

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.740
and Routing, Agent availability and wait time.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:17.036
It lists each agent, with Why not eligible and Routing detail, in words.

00:00:17.526 --> 00:00:21.625
The Dialer decision log shows the same for outbound work.

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:27.676
Each decision lists the agents that were weighed, and why each was or was not eligible.

